      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779878290519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "when we do the \n    > java Main\n\nour compiler will see for the Main class and we know that every program \nneeds a starting piont here main() method is the starting point\n\nas our main method is public \nand our class is also public so \nour compiler will simply do\n\n    > <className>.main();\n    > Main.main();\n    > Employee.main();",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when we do the \n    > java Main\n\nour compiler will see for the Main class and we know that every program \nneeds a starting piont here main() method is the starting point\n\nas our main method is public \nand our class is also public so \nour compiler will simply do\n\n    > <className>.main();\n    > Main.main();\n    > Employee.main();",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
