      "text": "Important points",
      "fontSize": 42.52688678499645,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Important points",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MFGDdNzZnkONE4b2KGLyE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31530.546185607767,
      "y": -8916.600140550103,
      "width": 1367.5159170038933,
      "height": 46.94851744848361,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 629076691,
      "version": 278,
      "versionNonce": 1202359059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> At a given point of time a Single Thread is being execting in a Program",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> At a given point of time a Single Thread is being execting in a Program",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J5LHi8dLPzP8JGhPPNnBu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33508.403356393945,
      "y": -9063.74293229815,
      "width": 75.43792724609375,
      "height": 46.94851744848361,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1609181757,
      "version": 348,
      "versionNonce": 1181066141,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IMP",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IMP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tYF_J2td8t9LVk22_qHQv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33512.28091987051,
      "y": -8986.395999750717,
      "width": 1698.1605224609375,
      "height": 140.8455523454508,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1242181299,
      "version": 588,
      "versionNonce": 1995288755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The data for Primitives will be stored in stack memory\n\nThe data for Non-Primitives will be stored in Heap and the reference will be stored in Stack ",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The data for Primitives will be stored in stack memory\n\nThe data for Non-Primitives will be stored in Heap and the reference will be stored in Stack ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2vjpL9DmrdybmCXHVf_3C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31530.546185607767,
      "y": -8599.457348802056,
      "width": 1440.98095703125,
      "height": 93.89703489696721,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 175631155,
      "version": 513,
      "versionNonce": 2089363453,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> In the initial stage when we run the java program the main() method will be\n    loaded in to stack memory for that a stack frame will be created",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> In the initial stage when we run the java program the main() method will be\n    loaded in to stack memory for that a stack frame will be created",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sHQw9mkPbNkwz8up-BSxg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31530.546185607767,
      "y": -8464.457348802056,
      "width": 1325.32666015625,
      "height": 46.94851744848361,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1117067965,
      "version": 651,
      "versionNonce": 1241195091,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> For every method call a new stack frame will be created in the Stack",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> For every method call a new stack frame will be created in the Stack",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mn0XcwG-RO_wL3MkBj3TI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31530.546185607767,
      "y": -8351.919974799304,
      "width": 1360.473388671875,
      "height": 93.89703489696721,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1817308317,
      "version": 917,
      "versionNonce": 1081942109,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> All the static variables and methods will be stored in the Method Area\n    for every class it will create a new \"Class Frame\" in method area",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> All the static variables and methods will be stored in the Method Area\n    for every class it will create a new \"Class Frame\" in method area",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_TdEcgit5KDhLs6Zv-W0K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31530.546185607767,
      "y": -8844.60950508358,
      "width": 1210.633059808995,
      "height": 46.94851744848361,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1308433203,
      "version": 437,
      "versionNonce": 1772707827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "O6cyiWKPipaGw2Ie2tSIs",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1779872773885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> In the Stack Area for \"Every Thread\" a stack will be created ",
      "fontSize": 37.558813958786885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> In the Stack Area for \"Every Thread\" a stack will be created ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WZYmaoE5yJOr0JYTJptI0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33026.24252407497,
